{
  "abstract": "We report measurements of the invariant cross section in the forward hemisphere for inclusive photoproduction of \u03c0\u00b1, K\u00b1, p, and p\u00af from hydrogen and deuterium with an incident photon energy of 18 GeV. A small amount of data was also taken at incident energies of 9 and 13 GeV. The measurements were made using the SLAC 20-GeV/c spectrometer, and a bremsstrahlung-subtraction technique was used to obtain the cross sections at the specified incident energy. The data are compared with those from lower-energy experiments and interpreted within the context of the Mueller-Regge model and the constituent-interchange model.",
